## Original Content
A new Apple documentary explores the life of Aziz “Zyzz” Shavershian, who rocketed to internet fame in an age before influencers, then died at age 22 in 2011.

## Summary
Aziz "Zyzz" Shavershian, a precursor to modern influencers, rose to internet fame and was known as the original "Looksmaxxer" before his untimely death at 22 in 2011. A new Apple documentary explores his life. His story's relevance is highlighted in the contemporary context.

## Key Points
- Aziz "Zyzz" Shavershian was an early internet celebrity known as the original "Looksmaxxer"
- He gained fame before the influencer era
- Died at 22 in 2011; his life is now featured in a new Apple documentary


